---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Orbits Privacy Policy | Jeremy Arde"
  description="Privacy policy for Orbits, a visual timer app."
>
  <article class="privacy-policy">
    <p class="eyebrow">Orbits</p>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="updated"><strong>Last updated:</strong> August 10, 2026</p>

    <p>
      Orbits is a visual timer app. Orbits is designed to work without
      collecting personal information.
    </p>

    <h2>Data we collect</h2>
    <p>
      Orbits does not collect, transmit, sell, or share personal data. We do not
      use analytics, advertising, tracking, accounts, or third-party data
      collection services.
    </p>

    <h2>Data stored on your device</h2>
    <p>
      Orbits stores your timers, goals, completion history, and app settings
      locally on your device so the app can work and preserve your preferences.
      This information is not sent to us or to any third party.
    </p>

    <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
    <p>
      Orbits does not knowingly collect personal information from anyone,
      including children.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      If this policy changes, we will update this page and its "Last updated"
      date.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      If you have questions about this policy, contact Jeremy at
      <a href="mailto:jeremy@jeremyarde.com">jeremy@jeremyarde.com</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .privacy-policy {
    max-width: var(--max-width-narrow);
    padding: 3rem 0 4rem;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-subtle);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.24em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  h1 {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .updated {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  h2 {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  p {
    max-width: 42rem;
  }
</style>
